v1.20.0: OpenAPI metadata for generated minimal API endpoints

Every route generated from an [Endpoint]-attributed command/query now gets
.WithName(...), .WithSummary(...) (forwarded from XML doc <summary>),
.WithTags(...), and .Produces<T>(...)/.Produces(...) automatically, so it
shows up correctly in Swagger UI / Microsoft.AspNetCore.OpenApi with zero
extra code.

- .WithName: derived from the request type name (Command/Query suffix stripped)
- .WithSummary: forwarded from the handler's Handle/HandleAsync XML doc summary
- .WithTags: the route's first path segment
- .Produces<T>/.Produces: real response type and status code (200/204)

Updated samples/AutoDispatch.MinimalApiSample with a doc-commented handler and
GenerateDocumentationFile=true to demonstrate the full pipeline end-to-end.
Updated README (Minimal API + XML doc comments sections) and CHANGELOG.
157/157 tests passing (Debug + Release).

